Qt PDF (QtPdf + QtPdfWidgets, pdfium) for WebAssembly, on Qt 6.11.2's qtwebengine.

From the qtpdf-wasm project (built and browser-tested there on Qt 6.11.3, single-threaded
wasm32; applies at zero fuzz to 6.11.2). Paths are relative to the qt-everywhere source root,
so build-qt-wasm.yml's patches/qt-*.patch loop applies it with the others. What it changes:
- configure.cmake: WASM is a supported QtPdf platform, emscripten clang a supported
  compiler; on wasm QtPdf needs only Qt::Gui.
- cmake/QtToolchainHelpers.cmake: GN arch "wasm", GN os "emscripten", GN args for the
  emsdk clang; Qt's wasm flags (-fwasm-exceptions -sSUPPORT_LONGJMP=wasm, -pthread,
  -msimd128, MEMORY64) are passed into pdfium so it is ABI-compatible with this Qt. emcc
  also appends EMCC_CFLAGS (-m64 -sWASM_LEGACY_EXCEPTIONS=0, toolchain/env.sh) to every
  pdfium compile, which is what makes the objects wasm64 on the new EH model.
- cmake/QtGnGen.cmake: GN runs with a dotfile rooted at the QtPdf target, since Chromium's
  //BUILD.gn cannot be evaluated for emscripten.
- src/pdf/CMakeLists.txt: toolchains and GN args for wasm (no partition_alloc etc.).
- src/pdf/qpdfpagerenderer.cpp: without thread support always SingleThreaded.
- chromium BUILDCONFIG.gn: target_os="emscripten" allowed for is_qtpdf; compiler/BUILD.gn:
  no -flto=full for QtPdf (plain objects in a static library, like the rest of Qt).
- pdfium fxge: the generic Linux font module (no system fonts; built-in base-14 fonts).
- pdfium libopenjpeg: no fseeko/ftello under emscripten.

diff --git a/qtwebengine/cmake/QtGnGen.cmake b/qtwebengine/cmake/QtGnGen.cmake
index 7522a2e..b451764 100644
--- a/qtwebengine/cmake/QtGnGen.cmake
+++ b/qtwebengine/cmake/QtGnGen.cmake
@@ -72,6 +72,15 @@ if(GN_THREADS)
 endif()
 
 file(READ ${build_dir}/args.gn gn_arg_arg)
+
+# WebAssembly (Qt PDF only): Chromium's //BUILD.gn pulls in lots of targets which can not
+# be evaluated for emscripten. Use a dotfile whose root is our QtPdf target instead.
+if(gn_arg_arg MATCHES "target_os=\"emscripten\"")
+    file(READ ${WEBENGINE_ROOT_SOURCE_DIR}/src/3rdparty/chromium/.gn gn_dotfile)
+    string(APPEND gn_dotfile "\n# Qt PDF for WebAssembly\nroot = \"${build_dir}:QtPdf\"\nroot_patterns = [ \"${build_dir}:QtPdf\" ]\n")
+    file(WRITE ${build_dir}/qtpdf_wasm.gn "${gn_dotfile}")
+    list(APPEND gn_arg --dotfile=${build_dir}/qtpdf_wasm.gn)
+endif()
 STRING(REGEX REPLACE "\n" ";" print_arg_arg "${gn_arg_arg}")
 LIST(SORT print_arg_arg)
 STRING(REGEX REPLACE ";" "\n" print_arg_arg "${print_arg_arg}")
